{"id":56802,"ord":162,"n_segments":179,"prev":56801,"next":56803,"doc":{"id":"68154","title":"68154_Gus Johnson oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Gus Johnson","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68154/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68154"},"chapter":"World's Greatest Jazz Band and Denver","title":"The McShann tribute and the Press Stuart band","category":"later_career","summary":"He played the 1977 McShann tribute and earlier with Press Stuart.","period":"1930s-1977","year_from":1930,"year_to":1977,"words":137,"start":[317,6],"end":[318,10],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68154#s56802","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Kansas City","focus":1,"type":"city"}],"venues":[{"name":"College Inn","focus":1,"city":"Kansas City"}],"bands":[{"name":"Press Stuart's band","focus":1,"leader":"Press Stuart"},{"name":"Jay McShann Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Jay McShann"}]},"people":[{"name":"Jay McShann","qid":"Q1684347","n":2},{"name":"Sy","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":17,"theme_name":"Playing with Count Basie: joining, leading, leaving","community":30,"community_name":"Playing with Count Basie: the band, its feel and its people","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":317,"b":6,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"See, like, MacShann, he -- they had a date for MacShann."},{"p":317,"b":7,"s":"MS.","x":"Last year."},{"p":317,"b":8,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"Last year."},{"p":317,"b":9,"s":"MS.","x":"Not till '77."},{"p":317,"b":10,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"Right, I made that with him."},{"p":317,"b":11,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah, that was very nice."},{"p":317,"b":12,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"Which was very nice."},{"p":317,"b":13,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah. Sy said that was very nice, indeed."},{"p":317,"b":14,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"I'm trying to get them to keep that [Muhlbach] going, too."},{"p":317,"b":15,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":317,"b":16,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"That was good, very good."},{"p":317,"b":17,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah. They don't have music so --"},{"p":317,"b":18,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"I played it with another band in Kansas City, called Press Stuart."},{"p":317,"b":19,"s":"MS.","x":"Oh?"},{"p":318,"b":0,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"And I was just looking at the pictures the other day."},{"p":318,"b":1,"s":"MS.","x":"No kidding? When was that?"},{"p":318,"b":2,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"This was before I joined Jay's band."},{"p":318,"b":3,"s":"MS.","x":"Was it?"},{"p":318,"b":4,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"It sure was."},{"p":318,"b":5,"s":"MS.","x":"That's nice. How about that?"},{"p":318,"b":6,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"Yeah. And --"},{"p":318,"b":7,"s":"MS.","x":"They have a good band?"},{"p":318,"b":8,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"Yeah, we played it -- we was playing at the College Inn then."},{"p":318,"b":9,"s":"MS.","x":"No kidding, fancy that."},{"p":318,"b":10,"s":"MR. JOHNSON","x":"Yeah."}]}